{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not the dim-witted cave Trolls Tolkien and Hollywood sold you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/c05e91351e598faf677a773cbfb6c0d0.avif?t=1761275980\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras_big/c05e91351e598faf677a773cbfb6c0d0.avif?t=1761275980 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reborn</i> is a glorious, hardcore revival of the beloved lane-defense classic played by over 1.3 million players. Here Norse myth meets mayhem, deep tactical challenges await, and Troll power takes center stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born in Norway, <i>Trolls vs Vikings: Reborn</i> unleashes the true Troll experience - ancient, stubborn, and fiercely loyal protectors of nature. As greedy Vikings and their gods march north in search of gold and glory, the Trolls rise to defend their lands with tactical wit, wild magic, and strikes so fierce even Odin thinks twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/00875d6e7dd6b61d175e63efb503cb0f.poster.avif?t=1761275980\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/00875d6e7dd6b61d175e63efb503cb0f.webm?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/00875d6e7dd6b61d175e63efb503cb0f.mp4?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Are The Troll Liberation Front - Crush the Viking Invasion!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Are you ready for some serious battle? Command a ragtag horde of the strangest, fiercest creatures ever to take up arms. Swipe, bash, dash, jump, and outsmart waves of gold-hungry Vikings fooled (of course) by Loki himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a \u201cplace-and-wait\u201d tower game. In Trolls Reborn every second demands fast decisions and faster hands: time spells, swap trolls, juggle resources, and react as chaos explodes across the field. Players call it the perfect blend of retro-hardcore tower defense and fresh new innovations, with a mix so balanced even Thor would nod in approval (then probably complain about the lack of mead).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/a76de5b8d45b8f0c615aed63d913f127.poster.avif?t=1761275980\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/a76de5b8d45b8f0c615aed63d913f127.webm?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/a76de5b8d45b8f0c615aed63d913f127.mp4?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutal Challenge. Fair Play. Maximum Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the three difficulty levels <i>Normal, Hard,</i> and <i>Brutal</i>, plus tons of special missions and the legendary Endless Valhalla Mode, <i>Reborn</i> is built for TD strategy connoisseurs. No shortcuts, no pay-to-win, no divine intervention. Every victory is earned through skill, timing, and stubborn Troll grit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Soundtrack Worthy of the Nordic Gods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a brand-new score by Hollywood composer Aleksandar Dimitrijevi\u0107, the Trolls themselves bring the music to life, literally. Critics have called it \u201cone of the best TD soundtracks ever made.\u201d Plug in your headphones and feel the mountain shake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/7a5fd5bf5a8c791f9be50991272b643c.poster.avif?t=1761275980\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/7a5fd5bf5a8c791f9be50991272b643c.webm?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/7a5fd5bf5a8c791f9be50991272b643c.mp4?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beautifully Reborn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire graphical landscape is brimming with fresh new details, and all new animations by an Annie Award\u2013nominated animation artist, giving the world more personality than ever. From lush forest to fiery battlefields, every frame bursts with Nordic charm and ridiculous detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/9c97b4f42a7bedcb073c1663b513fd0b.poster.avif?t=1761275980\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/9c97b4f42a7bedcb073c1663b513fd0b.webm?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/9c97b4f42a7bedcb073c1663b513fd0b.mp4?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deeper Progression, Smarter Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your loadout before every battle: swap Trolls, tweak spells, and tailor your tactics to each unique challenge. It\u2019s fair, flexible, and designed for those who crave mastery over mayhem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Valhalla Awaits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve seen it all? The gods laugh! Push your limits in Endless Valhalla Mode, where waves never stop and sleep becomes optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/be38438405030dfd901b2740148a936b.poster.avif?t=1761275980\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/be38438405030dfd901b2740148a936b.webm?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/be38438405030dfd901b2740148a936b.mp4?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A True Rebirth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built from the ground up for Steam, <i>Trolls vs Vikings: Reborn</i> delivers a pure TD experience. No compromises, just classic TD lane defense strategy, reborn for modern players craving only the finest gameplay experience.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bog BBQ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2940040/51fff3bfe436980b1b7a1ac1c2b4d7f22a2fba66.jpg"},{"name":"Red Alert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2940040/ec3173591fd9fdfe51e5dcacdac741bf78f67f63.jpg"},{"name":"Better Dead Than Red","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2940040/5d0063a7ebdcd7afdb4dc08a6a2fd60c2c48265d.jpg"},{"name":"Seeing Red","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2940040/09771bee92a3202d933da5c534e6b1a2d693fbff.jpg"},{"name":"Grand Melee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2940040/cb49971e15551d908005ad7ffbd4e9dc21c46ceb.jpg"},{"name":"TGI Thursday","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2940040/6de90081d8a9398f6e87965bc688e36c0f9adb57.jpg"},{"name":"Thunderstruck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2940040/0cf2b90b99eaaa5280bf2290679a6c11d9c1afe7.jpg"},{"name":"Totally Hammered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2940040/0249427c44f6ebab06f7236211922d2f4166af01.jpg"},{"name":"What Does The Goat Say?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2940040/b5c2191f36ce5e39daf07c14740efe7953090af7.jpg"},{"name":"Keeping An Eye Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2940040/df487f22f451bd1356f7ae3f8b29feece230a76b.jpg"}],"total":28},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2940040?t=1761275980","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761275980","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/675fda3f46cdc900380164054815199ab9350d71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761275980","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/675fda3f46cdc900380164054815199ab9350d71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761275980","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not the dim-witted cave Trolls Tolkien and Hollywood sold you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/c05e91351e598faf677a773cbfb6c0d0.avif?t=1761275980\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras_big/c05e91351e598faf677a773cbfb6c0d0.avif?t=1761275980 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Reborn</i> is a glorious, hardcore revival of the beloved lane-defense classic played by over 1.3 million players. Here Norse myth meets mayhem, deep tactical challenges await, and Troll power takes center stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born in Norway, <i>Trolls vs Vikings: Reborn</i> unleashes the true Troll experience - ancient, stubborn, and fiercely loyal protectors of nature. As greedy Vikings and their gods march north in search of gold and glory, the Trolls rise to defend their lands with tactical wit, wild magic, and strikes so fierce even Odin thinks twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/00875d6e7dd6b61d175e63efb503cb0f.poster.avif?t=1761275980\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/00875d6e7dd6b61d175e63efb503cb0f.webm?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/00875d6e7dd6b61d175e63efb503cb0f.mp4?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Are The Troll Liberation Front - Crush the Viking Invasion!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Are you ready for some serious battle? Command a ragtag horde of the strangest, fiercest creatures ever to take up arms. Swipe, bash, dash, jump, and outsmart waves of gold-hungry Vikings fooled (of course) by Loki himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a \u201cplace-and-wait\u201d tower game. In Trolls Reborn every second demands fast decisions and faster hands: time spells, swap trolls, juggle resources, and react as chaos explodes across the field. Players call it the perfect blend of retro-hardcore tower defense and fresh new innovations, with a mix so balanced even Thor would nod in approval (then probably complain about the lack of mead).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/a76de5b8d45b8f0c615aed63d913f127.poster.avif?t=1761275980\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/a76de5b8d45b8f0c615aed63d913f127.webm?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/a76de5b8d45b8f0c615aed63d913f127.mp4?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutal Challenge. Fair Play. Maximum Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the three difficulty levels <i>Normal, Hard,</i> and <i>Brutal</i>, plus tons of special missions and the legendary Endless Valhalla Mode, <i>Reborn</i> is built for TD strategy connoisseurs. No shortcuts, no pay-to-win, no divine intervention. Every victory is earned through skill, timing, and stubborn Troll grit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Soundtrack Worthy of the Nordic Gods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a brand-new score by Hollywood composer Aleksandar Dimitrijevi\u0107, the Trolls themselves bring the music to life, literally. Critics have called it \u201cone of the best TD soundtracks ever made.\u201d Plug in your headphones and feel the mountain shake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/7a5fd5bf5a8c791f9be50991272b643c.poster.avif?t=1761275980\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/7a5fd5bf5a8c791f9be50991272b643c.webm?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/7a5fd5bf5a8c791f9be50991272b643c.mp4?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beautifully Reborn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire graphical landscape is brimming with fresh new details, and all new animations by an Annie Award\u2013nominated animation artist, giving the world more personality than ever. From lush forest to fiery battlefields, every frame bursts with Nordic charm and ridiculous detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/9c97b4f42a7bedcb073c1663b513fd0b.poster.avif?t=1761275980\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/9c97b4f42a7bedcb073c1663b513fd0b.webm?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/9c97b4f42a7bedcb073c1663b513fd0b.mp4?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deeper Progression, Smarter Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your loadout before every battle: swap Trolls, tweak spells, and tailor your tactics to each unique challenge. It\u2019s fair, flexible, and designed for those who crave mastery over mayhem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Valhalla Awaits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve seen it all? The gods laugh! Push your limits in Endless Valhalla Mode, where waves never stop and sleep becomes optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/be38438405030dfd901b2740148a936b.poster.avif?t=1761275980\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/be38438405030dfd901b2740148a936b.webm?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/extras/be38438405030dfd901b2740148a936b.mp4?t=1761275980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A True Rebirth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built from the ground up for Steam, <i>Trolls vs Vikings: Reborn</i> delivers a pure TD experience. No compromises, just classic TD lane defense strategy, reborn for modern players craving only the finest gameplay experience.</p>","developers":["Megapop"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940040/header.jpg?t=1761275980","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c) Megapop AS 2024.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailer